/E (The defining feature of Apple's push into wearable AI devices will be Visual Intelligence. Apple CEO Tim Cook has been dropping hints about AI wearables built around AI technology that can see the surrounding environment and use that context to take action. The company is working on its own visual models with the intention of making them central to its upcoming set of AI devices, which include advanced AirPods, smart glasses, and a pendant. Apple plans to hold its first product launches of the year in March.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
>>
