/P 134 0 R
/E (Over the last one and a half months alone, we hosted 4 events: mock case calls, workshops, and fireside chats. A huge shoutout to Zuhaib and Vinayak from the Alumni team for bringing in some really fresh panels for the fire chats and creating a space where students could genuinely learn and take something useful away. Shoutout as well to the Comms team: Lou and Priyanka, for consistently backing us and helping amplify every event. The growing turnout each time, along with professors joining the firechats, speaks for itself.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
